a run of blank lines: fixpoint
a blank first line: fixpoint
a blank last line: fixpoint
no final newline: fixpoint
space behind a declaration: fixpoint
a trailing comment: fixpoint
comments and nothing else: fixpoint
an empty file: fixpoint
a long argument list, packed: fixpoint
a long argument list, already broken: fixpoint
a long union, packed: fixpoint
a long union, already broken: fixpoint
